<title>UK: LIFFE sugar closes one hour later April 1-4.</title>
<headline>LIFFE sugar closes one hour later April 1-4.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The LIFFE sugar market will be closing one hour later, local time, on Tuesday, April 1 through to Friday, April 4, an exchange spokesperson said on Thursday.</p>
<p>This is to compensate for the change over to British Summer</p>
